data_synthetic_mse
# Synthetic. NOT a deposit. Guards the chain-classification bug: one non-standard
# residue (MSE) used to reclassify a whole TERT chain as OTHER, so TERT was
# dropped and the longest remaining protein (a histone) was analysed instead.
